// LOCALHOST

### Get all contacts
GET http://localhost:8080/contacts

### Get contact by id
GET http://localhost:8080/contacts/644f6c8d9823b4c1e691b60a

### Create contact
POST http://localhost:8080/contacts HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
    "firstName":"Ashley",
    "lastName":"Weaver",
    "email":"aWeaver@test.com",
    "favoriteColor":"Brown",
    "birthday":"06/19/2000"
}

### PUT contact / update
PUT http://localhost:8080/contacts/64573047f307c220b23dd059 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
    "firstName":"Sarah",
    "lastName":"Birch",
    "email":"test@gmail.com",
    "favoriteColor":"Green",
    "birthday":"12/12/20"
}
### DELETE contact
DELETE http://localhost:8080/contacts/64573047f307c220b23dd059 HTTP/1.1


